      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ANTI VENOM (3) is long overdue for a win, finishing in the minors at her last three starts, the latest jumping from this same box when second in a Grade 5 at Capalaba (19.95). Good beginner and aided by a handy draw. Has the ability and looks a key chance. INSTALLER (7) flew around 390m at this track in 21.78 three back then has been in the money the last two since. Top win three back and can measure up again. SOLAR POWER (1) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by a nose at Q Straight in a handy 16.83 beating Tsunami Sea. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in two starts. One of the key runners again. CHEVY STORM (2) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can atone.",
